### TaskBoard API — runnable requests (Visual Studio, VS Code REST Client, Rider).
### Start the API first: dotnet run --project src/TaskBoard.Api  (http://localhost:5080)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Anonymous endpoint (no token needed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/ping

### Protected endpoint without a token → 401 with the ApiResult envelope
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks

### Log in as the seeded demo user (copy data.accessToken into @token below)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.test",
  "password": "DemoPass123!"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My tasks (overdue first; dueDateLocal is in America/Sao_Paulo for the demo user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a task — dueDate is local wall-clock time in the user's timezone (no offset)
# @name create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Prepare technical interview",
  "description": "Review Clean Architecture",
  "dueDate": "2026-10-21T15:00"
}

###
@taskId = {{create.response.body.$.data.id}}

### Validation errors → 400 with validationErrors
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "dueDate": "2026-10-21T15:00:00Z"
}

### Move to another Kanban column
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "done" }

### Full update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Prepare technical interview (updated)",
  "description": null,
  "dueDate": "2026-10-22T10:00",
  "status": "inProgress"
}

### Delete → 204 No Content
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Another user's task (Bob's) → 404, never 403, to avoid id enumeration
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/b0b00000-7a5c-7000-8000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Register (does not sign in)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carol Smith",
  "email": "carol@example.test",
  "timeZone": "Europe/London",
  "password": "CarolPass123!"
}
